    <string name="suggestions_details_patch_trust_unavailable">未在本机验证</string>
    <string name="suggestions_details_patch_trust_unavailable_desc">此版本未包含验证密钥，因此无法在此设备上检查签名。补丁仍会应用，但未经验证</string>
    <string name="suggestions_details_patch_trust_failed">签名不匹配</string>
    <string name="suggestions_details_patch_trust_failed_desc">此补丁的签名与应用内置密钥不匹配。补丁可能已被篡改，也可能是应用密钥过期。补丁不会应用，请联系支持人员</string>
